# Normalize line endings to LF for all text files (abapGit + tooling expect LF)
#
# The framework's own src/ is pulled into SAP systems by abapGit, which expects
# LF, and CONVENTIONS §6 asks for this file in every repository that carries
# ABAP or generated trees. The delivery trees themselves are no longer
# committed here - they are built into the gitignored tools/out/ and shipped
# byte for byte by frontend_deploy, so no attribute of this repository can
# touch them any more.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.abap text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.jsonc text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
